  "details": "- fix CVE-2026-61915: double-free in the CalDAV VPATCH BYPARAM selector\n- fix CVE-2026-61909: calendar/addressbook-multiget returned resources the user has no ACL on\n- fix CVE-2026-61911: Sieve mailboxexists/metadata probed other users' mailboxes without a lookup-rights check\n- do not free VPATCH parameters already removed by reference: libical frees them in icalproperty_remove_parameter_by_ref(), so the following icalparameter_free() aborted the CalDAV worker on any VPATCH carrying a PATCH-ACTION parameter, before the CVE-2026-61915 code path could be reached\n- add the upstream cunit regression test for CVE-2026-61915\n- run the cunit suite in %check even when cassandane is disabled, so the regression test above actually executes",
